Template: dalker/disable_wayland
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Use Xorg for the login screen and desktop sessions?
 Dalker can only capture Xorg screens. GDM uses Wayland by default, so the
 login screen and Wayland sessions would show up black or not at all.
 .
 Answering yes sets WaylandEnable=false in /etc/gdm3/custom.conf (a backup is
 kept and restored when Dalker is removed). It takes effect after a reboot.
